    "payload": {
      "content": "Theorem 20.2 Assume that the treatment is determined by Z = I(X ≥x0)\nwhere x0 is a predetermined threshold. Assume that E{Y (1) | X = x} is\ncontinuous from the right at x0 and E{Y (0) | X = x} is continuous from the\nleft at x0. Then the local average treatment effect at X = x0 is identified by"
